      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This presentation has reviewed and discussed the various temporomandibular musculoskeletal disorders with which patients present. Also, a step-by-step sequence of treatment has been presented. Following this escalating sequence of conservative yet appropriate therapy will provide a logical plan of treatment for painful temporomandibular disorders and the majority of patients should be treated successfully (Fig. 30)."},
